---
import UesProjectFrame from '../../../components/UesProjectFrame.astro';
import desk from '../../../data/ues-project-briefs.json';
---
<UesProjectFrame title="Three rooms for learning · UES Project Desk" description="Three proposed University of El Segundo builds for Claude Code: Field School, Studio Exchange and Exhibition Hall. Public briefs, existing classes preserved.">
  <div id="project-content">
    <section class="up-hero">
      <div class="up-hero-copy"><p class="up-kicker">PROJECT DESK / 2026 · EL SEGUNDO, CALIFORNIA</p><h1>Three rooms.<br /><em>One school<br />without walls.</em></h1><p class="up-dek">Notice something. Work out who could help. Make the result ready to be seen. Three practical builds for the University’s next chapter.</p><a class="up-button up-button-light" href="#three-projects">Read the three briefs <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
      <div class="up-architecture" aria-hidden="true"><div class="up-orbit"></div><div class="up-tower up-tower-one"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="up-tower up-tower-two"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="up-tower up-tower-three"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="up-horizon"></div><p>01 / OBSERVE<br />02 / COLLABORATE<br />03 / PRESENT</p></div>
    </section>
    <section class="up-status" aria-label="Project status"><strong>PUBLIC BUILD BRIEFS</strong><p>Prepared for Claude Code. Implementation awaits acknowledgement. These pages describe proposed tools; the tools are not yet built.</p><span>02 OCT 2026</span></section>
    <section id="three-projects" class="up-section">
      <div class="up-section-heading"><p class="up-kicker">THE NEXT THREE BUILDS</p><h2>Practice, exchange,<br />then exhibition.</h2><p>Small extensions to existing UES resources. Each brief has a bounded scope, a keepable outcome and a testable finish.</p></div>
      <div class="up-project-grid">{desk.projects.map((p) => <article class={'up-project-card up-card-' + p.number}><div class="up-card-top"><span>{p.id}</span><span>PROPOSED BUILD</span></div><div class="up-card-art" aria-hidden="true"><b>{p.number}</b><i></i></div><p class="up-kicker">{p.tag}</p><h3><a href={'/ues/projects/' + p.slug}>{p.title}</a></h3><p class="up-card-subtitle">{p.subtitle}</p><p>{p.summary}</p><div class="up-card-bottom"><a href={'/ues/projects/' + p.slug}>Open the brief <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href={'/ues/projects/' + p.slug + '/brief.md'} download>Download</a></div></article>)}</div>
    </section>
    <section class="up-context"><div><p class="up-kicker">BUILT AROUND WHAT IS ALREADY HERE</p><h2>Keep the school.<br />Add a useful room.</h2></div><div><p>The existing class catalog, private progress records, RADIUS field instrument and El Segundo School art archive keep their roles. These proposals add practice cards, role rehearsal and exhibition preparation.</p><div class="up-resource-links"><a href="/ues">Explore existing classes ↗</a><a href="/ues/radius">RADIUS / 90245 ↗</a><a href="/el-segundo-school">The existing art archive ↗</a></div><p class="up-small">No new applications, profiles, participant uploads or contact collection. No claim of accreditation, a completed cohort or an implemented tool.</p></div></section>
  </div>
</UesProjectFrame>
